`,g.jsx(t.p,{children:"It’s easy to treat these protocols like competing algorithms chasing the same consensus goals - safety and liveness, picking one based on throughput benchmarks or implementation complexity. But if you strip away the math and the RPC diagrams, every consensus algorithm is really trying to solve one fundamental question:"}),`
